Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: details pane picture on a grey band, plain
 Properties button, Compact view

Refs #143. In the details pane the picture sits on a grey band across the
top and the rest is padded below; the Properties button is a lightly rounded
box with a thin outline. View > Compact view packs the details rows closer
(24 px instead of 32); it's kept in Lapin's own dev.lapinux.Explorer
settings. COSMIC's own session is unchanged.

